{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Kids Drawing》是一款讓幼兒一邊用手指畫圖、一邊聽見旋律的繪畫 App，適合喜歡色彩與聲音的小朋友。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-253.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>畫出會發聲的彩色塗鴉</h2>\n<p>小朋友只需選擇 12 種顏色，便可用手指自由畫線；每條線會即時發出聲音，不同顏色對應不同樂器音色。完成後按播放，畫作會亮起並隨播放頭演奏，亦可與大人合作把音樂畫作匯出成有聲影片。程式提供擦除、復原與重做，並會自動儲存畫作，無廣告、免帳戶，離線亦可使用。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-254-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-255-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-256-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-257-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-258-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Kids Drawing – Sound Doodle</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/kids-drawing-sound-doodle/id6825702362?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T18:24:40.426627+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":279,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T18:11:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T03:37:30.993091+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T18:18:04.635876+00:00","content_hash":"29dc61856e2a5e920454e4d224cf74a6e20a53fbe085e03d72d82fadba170542","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}